# From tracks_for_channel_stress.buda, but with EIGHT top layers: the stack
# continues the alternating H/V ladder up to M11, each pair coarser than the
# one below it (wider wires, wider power rails) as real top metal is.
# Overhead percentages are the patterns' measured values (1 - signal
# density) — see report_overhead below.

def_layer  2 M2  H LOW 55.56
def_layer  3 M3  V LOW 55.56
def_layer  4 M4  H TOP 55.56
def_layer  5 M5  V TOP 55.56
def_layer  6 M6  H TOP 66.67
def_layer  7 M7  V TOP 58.97
def_layer  8 M8  H TOP 57.14
def_layer  9 M9  V TOP 57.14
def_layer 10 M10 H TOP 56.76
def_layer 11 M11 V TOP 56.76

# Track patterns are REQUIRED for Detailed NUTS
# Format: <layer_id> <origin> [<type> <width> <spacing>] ...
def_track_pattern 2 -100  POWER 2 1  SIGNAL 1 0.5  SIGNAL 1 0.5  SIGNAL 1 0.5  SIGNAL 1 0.5  GROUND 2 1  SIGNAL 1 0.5  SIGNAL 1 0.5  SIGNAL 1 0.5  SIGNAL 1 0.5
def_track_pattern 3    0  POWER 2 1  SIGNAL 1 0.5  SIGNAL 1 0.5  SIGNAL 1 0.5  SIGNAL 1 0.5  GROUND 2 1  SIGNAL 1 0.5  SIGNAL 1 0.5  SIGNAL 1 0.5  SIGNAL 1 0.5
def_track_pattern 4 -200  POWER 2 1  SIGNAL 1 0.5  SIGNAL 1 0.5  SIGNAL 1 0.5  SIGNAL 1 0.5  GROUND 2 1  SIGNAL 1 0.5  SIGNAL 1 0.5  SIGNAL 1 0.5  SIGNAL 1 0.5
def_track_pattern 5    0  POWER 2 1  SIGNAL 1 0.5  SIGNAL 1 0.5  SIGNAL 1 0.5  SIGNAL 1 0.5  GROUND 2 1  SIGNAL 1 0.5  SIGNAL 1 0.5  SIGNAL 1 0.5  SIGNAL 1 0.5
def_track_pattern 6 -400  POWER 3 1  SIGNAL 1 1  SIGNAL 1 1 SIGNAL 1 1  SIGNAL 1 1  GROUND 3 1  SIGNAL 1 1 SIGNAL 1 1  SIGNAL 1 1  SIGNAL 1 1
def_track_pattern 7 -600  POWER 6 2  SIGNAL 2 1  SIGNAL 2 1  SIGNAL 2 1 SIGNAL 2 1  GROUND 6 1  SIGNAL 2 1 SIGNAL 2 1  SIGNAL 2 1  SIGNAL 2 1
def_track_pattern 8 -800  POWER 8 2  SIGNAL 3 1.5  SIGNAL 3 1.5  SIGNAL 3 1.5  SIGNAL 3 1.5  GROUND 8 2  SIGNAL 3 1.5  SIGNAL 3 1.5  SIGNAL 3 1.5  SIGNAL 3 1.5
def_track_pattern 9 -1000 POWER 8 2  SIGNAL 3 1.5  SIGNAL 3 1.5  SIGNAL 3 1.5  SIGNAL 3 1.5  GROUND 8 2  SIGNAL 3 1.5  SIGNAL 3 1.5  SIGNAL 3 1.5  SIGNAL 3 1.5
def_track_pattern 10 -1200 POWER 10 3  SIGNAL 4 2  SIGNAL 4 2  SIGNAL 4 2  SIGNAL 4 2  GROUND 10 3  SIGNAL 4 2  SIGNAL 4 2  SIGNAL 4 2  SIGNAL 4 2
def_track_pattern 11 -1400 POWER 10 3  SIGNAL 4 2  SIGNAL 4 2  SIGNAL 4 2  SIGNAL 4 2  GROUND 10 3  SIGNAL 4 2  SIGNAL 4 2  SIGNAL 4 2  SIGNAL 4 2

report_overhead
